sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SM as SessionManager
    participant TM as TaskManager
    participant Q as TaskQueue
    participant LM as LifecycleManager
    participant AL as AgentLoop
    participant Act as Actor
    participant GW as ToolGateway
    participant Obs as Observer
    participant TS as TaskService + 状态机

    SM->>TM: start_session(session_id, root_agent)
    TS--)TM: TASK_CREATED 事件
    TM->>Q: push(task_id)
    Note over Q: dag_deps 满足 → _ready 栈<br/>未满足 → _blocked 集合

    TM->>Q: pop() 取栈顶（LIFO，深度优先）
    TM->>TS: transition(task, ACTIVE)
    TM->>LM: prepare_executor(use_subagent, template, inherit_memory)
    LM->>AL: run(session_id, agent_id, task_id)

    AL->>AL: Reasoner.reason() → ReasoningContext
    AL->>Act: act(ctx) 
    loop 每轮，上限 actor_max_tool_rounds
        Act->>GW: call(tool_name, args, capability)
        GW-->>Act: ToolResult
    end
    Act-->>AL: ActorResult(output, exit_reason)

    alt task.status == SUSPENDED（等待人工回答）
        AL->>AL: 写挂起 memory 后 return
        Note over AL: 用户回答后 task 重新入队，<br/>下一轮从 run() 重新开始
    else 正常路径
        AL->>Obs: observe(result, ctx, task)
        Obs->>TS: submit_task_assessment(status, process_report)
        Note over TS: success / failed / active / ask_human<br/>转换须通过 _TASK_TRANSITIONS 校验
    end

    AL-->>LM: 返回，agent 置 WAITING 或 FINISHED
    TS--)TM: TASK_EXECUTION_FINISHED 事件
    TM->>Q: notify_completed(task_id)
    Note over TM,Q: _blocked 中依赖已满足的移入 _ready
    TM->>Q: pop() 继续下一个；队列空则结束 session
